 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "RankedCache(capacity) holds at most capacity entries. put(key, value, rank) on a key already cached replaces its value and rank. On a new key when the cache already holds capacity entries, it first evicts the entry with the smallest rank; among equal ranks, the one whose last write is oldest (the preview allows any, so this tie rule is chosen for determinism). get never changes the cache order. get(key) returns the cached value or \"\" when the key is not cached. Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
    "revision": null,
    "path": "projects/algorithm_solver/catalogue/authored/hack2hire-chunk10-a-20261028-v1/contracts.json",
